# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KORR Building Co — what does NOT belong in this repository.
#
# Netlify publishes site/ and nothing else, so a file's being committed no
# longer means it is on the internet. It does still mean it is in the history
# of a repository, which is reason enough to keep working files out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# NOTE ON THE CAMERA ORIGINALS
# site/images/**/*.jpeg and photos-inbox/ are ~81 MB. The site serves only the
# -640/-1280 .webp variants, and since the move to site/ the inbox is not
# served at all. They are deliberately still tracked, because this repo is
# currently their only off-machine copy. Once they are backed up somewhere
# else, uncommenting the block below drops the repo from ~96 MB to ~15 MB.
#
# site/images/**/*.jpeg
# site/images/**/*.jpg
# site/images/**/*.png
# photos-inbox/

# Captured copies of the previous site + superseded data
archive/

# Working files
data/shipping-set.txt
data/direction-payload*.json
data/new-photos.json
.claude/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
